"One glide can read as a few words; the single word stays in the bar." = "Bitta surish bir necha so‘z deb o‘qilishi mumkin; yakka so‘z panelda qoladi.";
"The second half of the word comes from your other thumb." = "So‘zning ikkinchi yarmi boshqa bosh barmog‘ingizdan keladi.";
"Glide across the letters of “hello” and lift at the end." = "“hello” harflari ustidan suring va oxirida barmoqni ko‘taring.";
" After “th”, the likely “e” gets more room." = " “th”dan keyin ehtimolli “e” ko‘proq joy oladi.";
"Letters give up room to the keys beside them." = "Harflar o‘z yonidagi tugmalarga joy beradi.";
"Letters take room from the keys beside them." = "Harflar o‘z yonidagi tugmalardan joy oladi.";
"Each key's touch area is the key you see." = "Har bir tugmaning tegish hududi siz ko‘rayotgan tugmaning o‘zi.";
"No vibration on key presses." = "Tugma bosilganda tebranish yo‘q.";
"Tap the key to feel it. Wider means softer, taller means stronger." = "Sezish uchun tugmani bosing. Kengroq — yumshoqroq, balandroq — kuchliroq degani.";
"Play the vibration" = "Tebranishni ijro etish";
"New words simply replace the old ones, with nothing in between." = "Yangi so‘zlar eskilarini oraliq effektsiz almashtiradi.";
"The old words fade out as the new ones fade in." = "Yangi so‘zlar paydo bo‘lganda eskilari xira tortib yo‘qoladi.";
"New words float up into place while the old ones drift away above." = "Yangi so‘zlar joyiga ko‘tarilib keladi, eskilari esa tepaga suzib ketadi.";
"New words glide in along the reading direction and push the old ones out." = "Yangi so‘zlar o‘qish yo‘nalishida sirpanib kiradi va eskilarini siqib chiqaradi.";
"New words spring in from slightly smaller, with a little bounce." = "Yangi so‘zlar sal kichikroq holatdan ozgina sakrab chiqadi.";
"Word suggestions" = "So‘z takliflari";
"Words to finish or fix what you're typing, above the keys." = "Yozayotganingizni tugatish yoki tuzatish uchun tugmalar ustidagi so‘zlar.";
