"Three equal places, like the system keyboard." = "Tizim klaviaturasidagidek uchta teng joy.";
"Each word as wide as it needs, so up to six fit." = "Har bir so‘z kerak bo‘lgancha keng, shuning uchun oltitagacha so‘z sig‘adi.";
"Up to ten words in a strip you swipe sideways." = "Yon tomonga suriladigan lentada o‘ntagacha so‘z.";
